   - ``refine/narrow fix``: the fix direction is correct but too broad or incomplete
   - ``partially revert``: revert only the part of the latest change from specific lines that caused unrelated regression
    - ``escalate to requirement clarification``: the result indicates requirement-level issue.
    - ``adjust scope/trace and rerun``: the result may be caused by insufficient or misleading bounds
2. Give model-improvement guidance for RE
   - Specify constraints, guards, relaxations, or scoped fixes needed to better align the model with the current requirements.
